_to_ev":2.36,"fcf_to_mcap":1.33,"liab_to_assets":80.2,"cash_to_assets":7.6,"current_ratio":1.53,"roe":74.5,"roa":13.4,"moat":{"ticker":"JBS","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"JBS 作為全球最大的肉類加工商之一，在品牌定價權方面展現出中等實力。雖然其旗下擁有如 Swift、Friboi 等知名品牌，能在特定市場和產品類別中獲得一定的溢價，但整體而言，肉類行業的商品屬性較強，消費者對價格敏感度高，品牌忠誠度相對較弱。JBS 的品牌優勢更多體現在分銷網絡和規模經濟上，而非能獨立於市場供需大幅提價的強勢品牌。與可口可樂或蘋果等擁有極強品牌護城的公司相比，JBS 的品牌定價能力仍有提升空間，尤其是在面對原物料價格波動時，其轉嫁能力受到限制。","comment_en":"As one of the world's largest meat processors, JBS demonstrates moderate strength in brand pricing power. While it owns well-known brands like Swift and Friboi, which can command certain premiums in specific markets and product categories, the meat industry is largely characterized by its commodity nature. Consumers are highly price-sensitive, and brand loyalty is relatively weaker. JBS's brand advantage is more evident in its distribution network and economies of scale rather than a strong brand that can significantly raise prices independently of market supply and demand. Compared to companies with exceptionally strong brand moats like Coca-Cola or Apple, JBS's brand pricing ability has room for improvement, especially when facing raw material price fluctuations, as its ability to pass on costs is limited."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"JBS 在專利和監管壁壘方面得分較低。肉類加工行業的進入門檻主要在於規模、分銷網絡和食品安全標準，而非依賴專利技術。雖然 JBS 需要遵守嚴格的食品安全法規和進出口規定，這些構成了營運的必要條件，但這些監管並非 JBS 獨有的、能阻止競爭對手進入的專利或特許權。其競爭優勢更多來自於營運效率和規模，而非受專利保護的獨特技術或產品。因此，在專利和監管壁壘這一維度上，JBS 的護城河非常薄弱。","comment_en":"JBS scores low on patents and regulatory barriers. The barriers to entry in the meat processing industry are primarily related to scale, distribution networks, and food safety standards, rather than relying on patented technologies. While JBS must comply with strict food safety regulations and import/export rules, which are necessary operational conditions, these regulations are not patents or licenses unique to JBS that prevent competitors from entering. Its competitive advantages stem more from operational efficiency and scale than from proprietary technologies or products protected by patents. Therefore, JBS's moat in terms of patents and regulatory barriers is very weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"JBS 在轉換成本方面得分為中等偏弱。對於終端消費者而言，更換肉類品牌或購買地點的轉換成本極低，主要受價格、便利性和品牌偏好影響。然而，對於餐飲業者、零售商等 B2B 客戶，更換供應商會涉及供應鏈的重新協調、質量標準的驗證以及潛在的供應不確定性，這構成了一定的轉換成本。JBS 憑藉其龐大的產能和穩定的供應能力，能為這些客戶提供一定的穩定性，但這種轉換成本並非牢不可破，競爭對手若能提供更優的價格或服務，仍有機會爭取客戶。因此，轉換成本壁壘相對有限。","comment_en":"JBS scores moderately weak in switching costs. For end consumers, the cost of switching meat brands or purchase locations is extremely low, primarily influenced by price, convenience, and brand preference. However, for B2B customers such as food service providers and retailers, changing suppliers involves re-coordinating supply chains, verifying quality standards, and potential supply uncertainties, which constitute certain switching costs. JBS, with its vast production capacity and stable supply capabilities, can offer a degree of reliability to these clients. However, these switching costs are not insurmountable, and competitors can still gain customers by offering better prices or services. Therefore, the switching cost barrier is relatively limited."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"JBS 在網絡效應方面幾乎沒有護城河。網絡效應通常出現在平台型業務中，例如社交媒體、電子商務平台或支付系統，用戶越多，價值越大。肉類加工行業的商業模式並非基於此。JBS 的業務是將農產品加工成食品，其價值鏈的優勢在於規模、效率和供應鏈管理，而非用戶之間的互動。無論是供應商（農民）還是客戶（零售商、餐飲業），他們與 JBS 的交易並不因為其他用戶與 JBS 的交易而變得更有價值。因此，網絡效應在此行業和公司身上不適用，護城河極弱。","comment_en":"JBS has virtually no moat in terms of network effects. Network effects typically occur in platform-based businesses, such as social media, e-commerce platforms, or payment systems, where more users lead to greater value. The business model of the meat processing industry is not based on this. JBS's business involves processing agricultural products into food, and its value chain advantages lie in scale, efficiency, and supply chain management, not in user interactions. Neither suppliers (farmers) nor customers (retailers, food service) find their transactions with JBS more valuable because of other users' transactions with JBS. Therefore, network effects are not applicable to this industry and company, resulting in an extremely weak moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"JBS 在規模成本優勢方面擁有極為強大的護城河。作為全球最大的肉類生產商之一，JBS 受益於巨大的規模經濟效應。其龐大的採購量使其在向農民採購原材料時擁有強大的議價能力，能獲得更低的採購成本。同時，其遍佈全球的生產設施和高效的物流網絡，能夠攤薄固定成本，並優化生產和運輸效率。這種規模優勢使得新進入者難以匹敵其成本結構，尤其是在商品化程度高的肉類市場，成本是決定競爭力的關鍵因素。這是一個典型的「收費橋」式護城河，規模越大，成本越低，越能吸引更多業務。","comment_en":"JBS possesses an extremely strong moat in terms of cost advantage from scale. As one of the world's largest meat producers, JBS benefits from significant economies of scale. Its massive procurement volume gives it strong bargaining power when purchasing raw materials from farmers, allowing it to achieve lower acquisition costs. Concurrently, its global network of production facilities and efficient logistics optimize production and transportation, spreading fixed costs. This scale advantage makes it difficult for new entrants to match its cost structure, especially in the highly commoditized meat market where cost is a critical determinant of competitiveness. This is a classic 'toll bridge' type of moat: the larger the scale, the lower the cost, attracting more business."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"JBS 在獨特地理資產方面具有中等程度的護城河。公司在全球範圍內擁有廣泛的生產基地、加工廠和分銷網絡，這些資產的地理位置使其能夠貼近主要的肉類生產區域和消費市場，從而降低運輸成本並確保供應的及時性。尤其是在巴西、美國、歐洲和澳洲等關鍵市場，其佈局使其能有效利用當地資源並滿足當地需求。然而，這些資產雖然龐大且佈局廣泛，但其地理位置的「獨特性」相對有限，競爭對手同樣可以通過併購或新建設施來複製類似的地理佈局。因此，這是一個有價值的資產，但並非難以複製的獨特壁壘。","comment_en":"JBS has a moderate moat in unique geographical assets. The company owns extensive production bases, processing plants, and distribution networks globally. The geographical locations of these assets allow it to be close to major meat production regions and consumer markets, thereby reducing transportation costs and ensuring timely supply. Particularly in key markets like Brazil, the US, Europe, and Australia, its presence enables it to effectively utilize local resources and meet local demand. However, while these assets are substantial and widely distributed, their geographical 'uniqueness' is relatively limited, as competitors can replicate similar geographical layouts through mergers, acquisitions, or new facility construction. Therefore, it is a valuable asset but not an inimitable unique barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"JBS 在營運效率方面展現出堅固的護城河。作為行業領導者，JBS 持續投入於優化其複雜的全球供應鏈，包括從飼養、屠宰、加工到物流配送的每一個環節。透過先進的生產技術、自動化設備以及嚴格的質量控制體系，公司能夠最大化產出、最小化浪費，並確保產品質量的一致性。這種高效率不僅降低了生產成本，也提高了對市場變化的響應速度。與效率較低的競爭對手相比，JBS 能夠提供更具競爭力的價格和更可靠的供應，這構成了其重要的競爭優勢，是其能夠在激烈市場中保持領先地位的關鍵。","comment_en":"JBS demonstrates a solid moat in operational efficiency. As an industry leader, JBS continuously invests in optimizing its complex global supply chain, covering every stage from farming, slaughtering, and processing to logistics and distribution. Through advanced production technologies, automated equipment, and stringent quality control systems, the company maximizes output, minimizes waste, and ensures consistent product quality. This high efficiency not only reduces production costs but also enhances responsiveness to market changes. Compared to less efficient competitors, JBS can offer more competitive pricing and reliable supply, forming a significant competitive advantage and being key to its sustained leadership in a fierce market."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"JBS 在資本配置方面具有較為堅固的護城河。公司歷史上展現了通過戰略性併購來擴大規模、進入新市場和多元化產品組合的能力。例如，對 Pilgrim's Pride 的收購顯著增強了其在禽肉領域的地位。同時，JBS 也注重通過剝離非核心資產或業務來優化資產負債表，並將資源集中於核心競爭力。雖然偶爾的併購決策可能存在風險，但總體來看，管理層在尋找和整合具有協同效應的資產方面表現出較高的水準。其對股東回報的關注，如股息和股票回購，也顯示出其在資本配置上的考量。","comment_en":"JBS possesses a relatively solid moat in capital allocation. Historically, the company has demonstrated an ability to expand its scale, enter new markets, and diversify its product portfolio through strategic acquisitions. For instance, the acquisition of Pilgrim's Pride significantly strengthened its position in the poultry sector. Concurrently, JBS focuses on optimizing its balance sheet by divesting non-core assets or businesses and concentrating resources on core competencies. While occasional acquisition decisions may carry risks, overall, management has shown a high level of proficiency in identifying and integrating synergistic assets. Its attention to shareholder returns, such as dividends and share buybacks, also reflects its considerations in capital allocation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"JBS 在客戶保留方面具有中等程度的護城河。對於 B2B 客戶，如大型連鎖超市和餐飲集團，JBS 透過其穩定的產能、廣泛的產品線和可靠的供應鏈管理，能夠建立起相對穩固的合作關係。這些客戶依賴 JBS 提供大規模、標準化的肉類產品。然而，肉類行業的價格競爭激烈，客戶總是在尋求最佳的供應商。JBS 的客戶保留更多是基於其規模和效率帶來的性價比，而非客戶因產品或服務的獨特性而產生的強烈忠誠度。一旦競爭對手在價格、質量或服務上提供顯著優勢，客戶轉移的可能性依然存在。","comment_en":"JBS has a moderate moat in customer retention. For B2B customers, such as large supermarket chains and food service groups, JBS can establish relatively stable cooperative relationships through its consistent production capacity, broad product lines, and reliable supply chain management. These clients depend on JBS for large-scale, standardized meat products. However, the meat industry is intensely price-competitive, and customers are always seeking the best suppliers. JBS's customer retention is primarily based on the cost-effectiveness derived from its scale and efficiency, rather than strong loyalty generated by unique products or services. The possibility of customer defection remains if competitors offer significant advantages in price, quality, or service. Therefore, the moat here is moderate."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"JBS 的業務模式具有較強的持久性，體現了堅固的護城河。食品是人類的基本需求，肉類作為重要的蛋白質來源，其長期需求穩定。儘管 JBS 面臨原物料價格波動、食品安全事件、環保法規壓力以及消費者口味變化的挑戰，但其作為全球領先的肉類加工商，通過規模、效率和持續的戰略調整，能夠較好地應對這些風險。公司不斷尋求多元化發展，例如拓展植物肉等替代蛋白質產品，以及加強品牌建設，這些都有助於其在不斷變化的市場中保持競爭力，延長其業務的生命週期。其業務模式不易被顛覆，具有較強的抗風險能力。","comment_en":"JBS's business model exhibits strong durability, reflecting a solid moat. Food is a basic human necessity, and meat, as a vital source of protein, has stable long-term demand. Despite facing challenges from raw material price volatility, food safety incidents, environmental regulatory pressures, and changing consumer tastes, JBS, as a global leader in meat processing, can effectively navigate these risks through its scale, efficiency, and continuous strategic adjustments. The company actively pursues diversification, such as expanding into alternative protein products like plant-based meats and strengthening brand building, all of which help it maintain competitiveness in an evolving market and extend its business lifecycle. Its business model is not easily disrupted and possesses strong resilience."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"JBS 的經濟護城河主要建立在其無可匹敵的規模經濟和卓越的營運效率之上，這構成了其核心的「收費橋」式壁壘，使其能在高度商品化的肉類加工行業中保持成本領先地位。儘管公司在品牌定價權、客戶保留和資本配置方面展現出一定的實力，但這些壁壘相對較弱，易受市場波動影響。專利、網絡效應和獨特地理資產方面則幾乎沒有護城河。總體而言，JBS 是一家以規模和效率驅動的企業，其護城河堅固但非無懈可擊，屬於典型的商品型企業，其長期價值依賴於持續的成本控制和精準的資本配置能力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"JBS's economic moat is primarily built upon its unparalleled economies of scale and outstanding operational efficiency, forming its core 'toll bridge' barrier that allows it to maintain a cost leadership position in the highly commoditized meat processing industry. While the company demonstrates some strength in brand pricing power, customer retention, and capital allocation, these barriers are relatively weaker and susceptible to market fluctuations. It possesses virtually no moat in patents, network effects, or unique geographical assets. Overall, JBS is a scale and efficiency-driven enterprise with a solid, though not impenetrable, moat. It is a classic commodity-type business whose long-term value depends on sustained cost control and precise capital allocation capabilities.","evidenceHash":"01c4d33846d60a9d79197c6e6c748c91eb62964c5e7be56b698367432520cd9b","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"BRL","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T15:49:45.848Z","evidenceHash":"97749da3cc0442294c107ac7ac477872fac40e24b63277eb06c78f0800297b31"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"BRL","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T15:49:45.848Z","evidenceHash":"97749da3cc0442294c107ac7ac477872fac40e24b63277eb06c78f0800297b31"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/JBS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/JBS.png","website":"https://jbsglobal.com","ceo":"Gilberto Tomazoni","full_time_employees":"283000","description":"JBS NV is a food company that engages in the sale of beef, pork, lamb meat and poultry products. It offers its products to supermarkets, club stores, other retail distributors, and foodservice companies. The company was founded on October 9, 2019 and is headquartered in Amstelveen, the Netherlands.","description_en":"JBS NV is a food company that engages in the sale of beef, pork, lamb meat and poultry products. It offers its products to supermarkets, club stores, other retail distributors, and foodservice companies. The company was founded on October 9, 2019 and is headquartered in Amstelveen, the Netherlands.","description_zh":"Jbs N.V.（美股代碼：JBS）為 Consumer Defensive 領域之重要企業，專注於 Packaged Foods 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Stroombaan 16","city":"Amstelveen","state":"NH","zip":"1181 VX","country":"NL","phone":"31 20 656 4700","full_address":"Stroombaan 16, Amstelveen, NH 1181 VX, NL","range_52w":"10.61-18.65","year_high":18.65,"year_low":10.61,"all_time_high